    "body": "As [discussed](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kFIgpKV6lwQCfAheM_MWMBU3NMW0xLSWpm6miHbBBPY/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.4opani522zs2) yesterday on the WebPerfWG call (and as pointed out by @annevk elsewhere), this is not correct, as we'd need the navigation TAO to opt-in to the destination origin, rather than the source origin. I'll revamp. ",
